d wraps the previous.\n\n### Task 2: Add `pub mod handler;` to `ledger-core/src/lib.rs`\n\n### Task 3: Write comprehensive tests\n\nTest each handler individually:\n- CollectHandler: feed postings, verify collected\n- FilterHandler: feed postings, verify only matching ones pass through\n- CalcHandler: feed postings, verify running totals\n- SortHandler: feed unsorted postings, flush, verify sorted output\n- CollapseHandler: feed postings to same account, flush, verify consolidated\n- CountHandler: feed postings, verify count\n\nTest pipeline composition:\n- Build filter → sort → collect pipeline\n- Feed test postings through\n- Verify correct output\n\n### Task 4: Run tests\nAfter implementation, run `cargo check --workspace` then `cargo test --workspace`. All existing tests must continue to pass.\n\n**IMPORTANT**:\n- Use PATH=\"$HOME********/bin:$PATH:/usr/bin:/usr/local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin\" before any cargo commands\n- Read existing types (Posting, Transaction, Balance, Amount) before writing\n- The existing Filter<T> trait in filters/mod.rs should NOT be modified — keep it for backward compat\n- handler.rs is entirely new code — no conflicts with existing code\n- Make types Clone where needed for buffering\n- Add comprehensive tests\n</teammate-message>",
